<string_table>
	<!-- Quartz Device -->
	<string id="st_zad_device_quartz_name">
		<text>QUARTZ-1M Scanner</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_zad_device_quartz_short">
		<text>Quartz-1M</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_zad_device_quartz_desc">
		<text>An experimental anomalous study device designed to warn you about newly appeared artefacts. Place the scanner near the center of an anomaly field and it will start surveying. You will then receive a report of all the newly spawned artefacts in fields covered by a scanner from your current zone (their radio does not allow long range transmissions) everytime you enter it or an artefact spawns.</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_zad_quartz_pickup">
		<text>Pick Up Device</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_zad_quartz_placement_impossible">
		<text>The QUARTZ-1M can only be placed near the center of an anomaly field</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_zad_quartz_surveying">
		<text>QUARTZ-1M is now surveying %s in %s</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_zad_quartz_stopped_surveying">
		<text>QUARTZ-1M is no longer surveying %s in %s</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_zad_quartz_artefacts_detected">
		<text>New artefacts detected in %s:</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_zad_quartz_artefacts_line">
		<text>\n- %s: %s</text>
	</string>

	<!-- Topaz Device -->
	<string id="st_zad_device_topaz_name">
		<text>TOPAZ-1M Scanner</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_zad_device_topaz_short">
		<text>Topaz-1M</text>
	</string>
	<string id="st_zad_device_topaz_desc">
		<text>An experimental anomalous study device designed to recharge perk artefacts. Once placed, select a perk artefact from your inventory and the device will draw from the Zone's connection to the Noosphere to restore it to full condition over a minute. Be careful though, as the device is very unstable and if you take too much time getting it back, you risk having done all this for nothing. The strain put on the Topaz will force you to let it cool down between uses.</text>
	</string>

